{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the swampy, medieval world of <strong>Frogstool</strong>, a land of murky waters, towering castles, and ancient bubble magic. You play as <strong>Gubble</strong>, a brave but unlikely hero- a small frog with a tongue as strong as a sword and a quest as big as the bog itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The village of <strong>Frogstool </strong>is under siege by <strong>Cocferno</strong>, the fearsome Chicken Dragon, who has taken control of <strong>Fort</strong> <strong>Wubblewart</strong>, a towering stronghold at the edge of the land.\u00a0<strong>Gubble </strong>must\u00a0battle through overrun villages, navigate the eerie <strong>Titanfin </strong>Passage inside the belly of an Orca, and scale <strong>Fort</strong> <strong>Wubblewart </strong>itself\u00a0to challenge <strong>Cocferno </strong>at the tower\u2019s peak. \u00a0To save the <strong>Frogstool </strong>Village, <strong>Gubble</strong> must venture through dangerous lands, battle monstrous foes, and uncover the secrets of the lost Wart Knights\u2014a forgotten order that once stood against <strong>Cocferno</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Does <strong>Gubble </strong>have what it takes to reclaim the village, conquer <strong>Fort</strong> <strong>Wubblewart</strong>, and take down the dreaded <strong>Cocferno</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540920/extras/lvl_select.png?t=1740777758\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540920?t=1740777758","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740777758","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540920/64be68cf42092416212e163e2a3c5d60f012e3e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740777758","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s